Source: pve-qemu-anti-detection
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Hikaru <i@rua.moe>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10)
Standards-Version: 4.5.0

Package: pve-qemu-anti-detection
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, git, build-essential, devscripts, patch
Recommends: pve-qemu-kvm
Description: DKMS-like auto-patching for pve-qemu-kvm anti-detection
 Automatically patches pve-qemu-kvm with anti-detection modifications
 every time the package is installed or upgraded. Similar to DKMS for
 kernel modules, this package monitors pve-qemu-kvm changes and
 rebuilds it with anti-detection patches applied.
 .
 Features:
  - APT hook to detect pve-qemu-kvm installation/upgrade
  - Background rebuild via systemd service
  - Manual rebuild/upgrade commands
  - Patch version management
